Usage: agentctl gate [flags]

Description: Run CI security, rules, and stack verification gate
Category:    Inspect
Risk Tier:   LOW

Flags:
  --mode             Evaluation mode (working-tree | committed | staged) (-m)
  --tier             Enforce specific tier policies (free | pro | ultra | enterprise)
  --allow-protected  Bypass protected path checks for authorized maintainers
  --fix              Trigger automated OODA self-repair loop on failure
  --strict-locks     Enforce strict anti-tampering verification on test files
  --dry-run          Simulate gate evaluation without persisting evidence (-d)
  --json             Output structured JSON gate report (-j)

Examples:
  $ agentctl gate
  $ agentctl gate --mode working-tree
  $ agentctl gate --fix
  $ agentctl gate --json
